      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/aug/30/shooting-rave-party-switzerland",
      "description": "<p>Manhunt under way after Italian dies from her injuries in the town of Aarau in the early hours of Sunday </p><p>A manhunt is under way in Switzerland after a 22-year-old woman was killed ⁠and five people were injured, ⁠some seriously, in a ​shooting at a rave in the northern town of Aarau, local police have said.</p><p>In the attack in the early hours of Sunday at a techno party at a covered horse racetrack , an Italian woman died from her injuries at the scene, authorities said. All those caught up in the shooting were residents of Switzerland and in their 20s.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/aug/30/shooting-rave-party-switzerland\">Continue reading...</a>",
